@startuml prakt-4-sequence

!define PRIMARY_COLOR #E1F5FF
!define SECONDARY_COLOR #FFF9C4

title Диаграмма взаимодействия: Отправка уведомления и аудит

== Сценарий: Отправка уведомления студенту ==

participant "Client Code" as Client
participant "NotificationService" as Service
participant "Configuration" as Config
participant "Auditor" as Auditor
participant "File System" as FS

Client -> Service: send_notification(\n"student@test.com",\n"req-001",\n"Your appeal")

activate Service
    Service -> Config: get('notification_provider')
    activate Config
    Config -> Config: return 'email'
    deactivate Config

    Service -> Config: get('enable_audit')
    activate Config
    Config -> Config: return True
    deactivate Config

    Note over Service: Имитирует отправку\nуведомления

    alt enable_audit == True
        Service -> Auditor: record_notification(\n"system",\n"student@test.com",\n"req-001",\n"email",\n"sent")
        activate Auditor
            Auditor -> Auditor: Create AuditRecord
            Auditor -> Auditor: Add to _records list
        deactivate Auditor
    end

    Service -> Service: return True
deactivate Service

Client <-- Service: success=True

== Получение истории аудита ==

Client -> Auditor: get_records()
activate Auditor
    Auditor -> Auditor: return copy of _records
deactivate Auditor

Client <-- Auditor: List[AuditRecord]

Note over Client: Результат:\n1 запись об отправке\nстудентам с деталями

@enduml
